    "summary": "Finger-ring in the shape of a truck positioned on a shank. The truck is in the form of a 1950s/60s Dodge pick-up truck with a driver (either side), a dog in the back and a water container which is set with turquoise to indicate the water. The headlights are made of tigers eye pieces, the back lights of coral pieces. The wheels rotate. On the shank of the ring there is a dog either side, and a turquoise is set inside the shank. The ring is entirely constructed using heavy gauge silver which is stamped prior to assembly. &quot;Clarence Lee&quot; is engraved onto the base of the truck, on the inside of the ring.",
